{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC contains the Dimension &quot;Epic Dungeons&quot;. In it, you will have 5 musical themes, 5 ambient sounds and 10 stingers, all in the aesthetic of the D&amp;D genre. All that in the palm of your hand. The Dimension details are as follows: <br><br> <strong>D0004: Epic Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on a medieval adventure facing epic challenges</strong><br><strong>Paid Dimension (DLC)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Genre: D&amp;D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Tracks: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Our Secret (theme for dramatic moments)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Last Warrior (theme for combat)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Seeking the Truth (theme for dramatic moments)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A New Land (theme for city sceneries and calm moments)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Winds of Hope (theme for Tavern and City scenery)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Composer:\u00a0Franklly Thallyson</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602440/extras/Epic_Dungeons_v1.png?t=1743697510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Este projeto \u00e9 realizado com recursos da Lei Paulo Gustavo do Governo Federal operacionalizado pelo Governo de Goi\u00e1s, por meio da Secretaria de Estado da Cultura.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602440/extras/secult-leipaulogustavo-branca.png?t=1743697510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602440?t=1743697510","background_raw":"https://store.